    bio: "Mr. Manikya Kumar heads the GIS practice at Ecometrix Consultants Pvt. Ltd. and brings over 28 years of experience in Geographic Information Systems (GIS), Remote Sensing, urban planning, infrastructure development, utility mapping, and geospatial technologies. He has successfully delivered and managed projects across India and internationally for government agencies, private organizations, and multilateral institutions including the World Bank, Asian Development Bank (ADB), and the European Union.\n\nHis expertise spans geospatial database development, drone and LiDAR mapping, environmental planning, transportation master planning, utility asset management, and digital transformation initiatives. Having held leadership positions with organizations such as Egis India, Mott MacDonald, Cyient, and CyberTech, he brings extensive experience in managing multidisciplinary teams and large-scale infrastructure projects.\n\nA certified PMP® and PRINCE2 Practitioner, Mr. Kumar holds an M.Tech in Geo-Informatics & Surveying Technology and an M.Sc. in Geology. He continues to drive innovation in geospatial solutions and strengthen Ecometrix’s capabilities in delivering data-driven infrastructure and development projects.",
